{%- comment -%}
  A Shopify-hosted video from a `video` setting, for a media slot that also takes an image.
  Muted, looping, no controls. It plays only while it is on screen, and never on its own under
  reduced motion (the video's preview frame stays up as the poster). The script that drives it is
  tsAutoVideos in tonescan-scripts, which finds it by the ts-autovid class.
  Usage: {% render 'ts-video', video: block.settings.video, class: 'tl-tier__vid' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign vclass = 'ts-autovid ' | append: class -%}
{{ video | video_tag: muted: true, loop: true, playsinline: true, controls: false, preload: 'none', image_size: '1600x', class: vclass }}
